    "sections": {
        "description": "LanternWP is a WooCommerce block theme for stores of any kind, built entirely from WordPress and WooCommerce blocks, with no page builder required. Every screen a shopper sees has its own template: home page, shop and categories, product page, cart, checkout, order confirmation and My account, all editable in the Site Editor, with colors, fonts and spacing in Styles and four style variations to start from. Ready-made patterns cover heroes, product rows, categories, promotions, newsletters, about, contact, and shipping and returns. The header brings a mega menu, product search and a mini-cart; the product page a gallery, variations, specifications, reviews and a sticky Add to cart bar. Free shipping messages follow your WooCommerce shipping settings. Fast by design: styles load only where they are used, fonts are hosted in the theme and images load lazily. Accessible and translation-ready. A first-steps screen in Appearance → LanternWP guides the setup, and without WooCommerce it works as a blog and pages theme. Demos and docs: https://lanternwp.com"
    },
